                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “ ‘Mu kwezi kwa mbere, ku munsi wa cumi n'ine w'uko kwezi muzagire Pasika, ibe ibirori by'iminsi irindwi, imitsima idasembuwe abe ari yo iribwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi uwo munsi umwami azatanga ikimasa ho igitambo gitambirwa ibyaha, ku bwe no ku bwa rubanda rwose rwo mu gihugu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu minsi irindwi y'ibirori azature Uwiteka igitambo cyoswa, ibimasa birindwi, n'amasekurume y'intama adafite inenge arindwi, uko bukeye bw'iyo minsi uko ari irindwi, n'isekurume y'ihene ho igitambo gitambirwa ibyaha mu munsi wose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi azature n'ituro ry'ifu, ku kimasa cyose efa imwe y'ifu, no ku isekurume y'intama efa imwe, na hini y'amavuta ya elayo kuri efa yose y'ifu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
